# Email Configuration for AttendEase
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Replace the values below with your actual Gmail credentials.
#
# IMPORTANT: Use a Gmail App Password, NOT your regular Gmail password.
# To create an App Password:
#   1. Go to https://myaccount.google.com/security
#   2. Enable 2-Step Verification (required)
#   3. Go to https://myaccount.google.com/apppasswords
#   4. Create a new App Password for "Mail" → "Windows Computer"
#   5. Copy the 16-character password and paste it below (no spaces)
#
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
MAIL_SERVER='smtp.gmail.com'
MAIL_PORT='587'
MAIL_USERNAME='your_email@gmail.com'
MAIL_PASSWORD='your_16_char_app_password'

# AI Chatbot Configuration
# Get your API Key from: https://aistudio.google.com/
GEMINI_API_KEY='your_gemini_api_key_here'
